{
  "_comment": "Golden cases for the FHIR kernel. 'arm' holds only non-stock knobs. Every knob has (a) an identity case under the stock arm and (b) at least one behaviour case. tests/unit/test_harness_fhir_kernel.py runs these.",
  "request_cases": [
    {
      "id": "stock-identity-url",
      "arm": {},
